<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scores at the close on the second day of four-day Sheffield Shield cricket matches on Saturday.</p>
<p>In Adelaide: New South Wales 415 (Corey Richards 76, Greg Matthews 58, Brad McNamara 50) and 14-1, South Australia 137.</p>
<p>In Perth: Victoria 332 (Rohan Larkin 104, Ian Harvey 55), Western Australia 329 for three (Michael Hussey 147, Ryan Campbell 74, Damien Martyn 51 not out).</p>
